  "description": "After a night out with coworkers Soohyeon meets his untimely death via car accident. Upset that he died a virgin, Soohyeon curses his fate... only to be sent back to the land of the living as an incubus who must sleep with men. This complicates things when Soohyeon's awakening as an incubus leads to an intense encounter between him and Jinseong, his childhood friend and roommate. Amidst the confusion and physical intimacy, hidden feelings rise to the surface. What will the upcoming days hold for the both of them?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
